   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "# 🎨🔄 Styled Asset Pack + Turnarounds — Geekatplay GameAssetMake\n### (c) Geekatplay Studio / Vladimir Chopine — geekatplay.com\n\nThe universal text→asset-pack pipeline, upgraded with the two consistency nodes:\n\n1. **🎮 Asset Planner** — your game concept → structured asset manifest.\n2. **🎨 Style Reference** — load a **moodboard image** (screenshot of the game you're\n   matching, a painting, a photo) and its art style is distilled into one style\n   sentence, appended to EVERY asset prompt. The whole pack shares one look\n   instead of drifting per-seed.\n3. **🔁 Batch Concept Generator** — one styled image per asset, verified single-object.\n4. **🖼️ Gallery** — PAUSES; tick what becomes 3D, choose rigging, or regenerate.\n5. **🔄 Orthographic Multi-View** — for every APPROVED asset, renders a consistent\n   front/left/right/back turnaround (same seed per asset across views). Views are\n   saved to `output/multiview/` and their paths recorded in the manifest\n   (`view_image_paths`) for multiview-capable 3D APIs and for your artists.\n6. **🧊 3D Generator → 📐 Placement → ⚡ Unreal Bridge** — the usual delivery.\n\n## 🎨 Style Reference properties\n- **extraction** — `vlm+palette` (default): local Ollama *vision* model (gemma3:12b)\n  writes the style sentence; free local palette/lighting analysis is the fallback.\n- **style_strength** — *subtle* appends the style at the prompt end; *strong* injects it\n  right after the subject so it dominates the render.\n- **extra_style_notes** — your own words, appended after the extracted style\n  (e.g. \"thick black outlines, hand-painted seams\").\n\n## 🔄 Multi-View properties\n- **views** — which orthographic views to render; the full 4-view turnaround is default.\n- The view phrase REPLACES the \"3/4 view\" wording in each prompt — two view\n  instructions in one prompt fight each other.\n- Same sampling settings as the concept pass; keep **seed fixed** so pressing\n  *Approve & Continue* reuses the cache instead of re-rendering.\n\n## Models (same as every GameAssetMake concept workflow)\nZ-Image Turbo: `UNETLoader → z_image_turbo_bf16.safetensors`,\n`CLIPLoader (lumina2) → qwen_3_4b.safetensors`, `VAELoader → ae.safetensors`,\n8 steps @ cfg 1.0, 16-channel latents. **dry_run_mock is ON** — flip it off to spend credits.\n"
   ],
   "title": "🎨🔄 READ ME — Styled Pack + Turnarounds",
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  },
